# routed.seismic: M = 3, H = 4, E = 4, K = 2, F = 3, S = 2 (shared width). Grouping: T = 2 tile
# rows, B = ceil((M * K + E * (T - 1)) / T) = 5 blocks; the expert and combine lines use the
# grouping of routes 3,1 / 0,2 / 1,3 (experts 0..3 own 1, 2, 1, 2 choices).
